@startuml ch11-agentic-lifecycle
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EEF2FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #CA8A04
skinparam arrowColor #6366F1
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #6366F1
skinparam DefaultFontColor #000000
skinparam ActivityFontColor #000000
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam NoteFontColor #000000

title K9X Agentic Process Development Lifecycle

|Architect|
start
:Provide project requirements,
current state, context, and scope;

|K9X Studio|
:Generate framework-compliant
scaffold from specification;

|SBB Architect / PM|
:Implement domain business logic
on the generated scaffold;
:Test and iterate;
:Create project and instance
in K9X Enterprise Continuum;
:Submit SBB for review;

|K9X Enterprise Continuum|
:Record submission
under the project's catalog;
:Notify Enterprise Architects
via K9X HIL;

|Enterprise Architect|
:Review submitted SBB;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  :Promote to shared tier,
  or harvest pattern to a
  new framework ABB;
else (no)
  :Return with feedback
  for rework;
  stop
endif

|K9X Enterprise Continuum|
:Catalog entry updated;
stop

@enduml
